| "G7=320001" 6:3{P 3 pm} 2:0{I} 4:0{P pm} 1:1{M 1} 6:3{P pm} 2:0{I} 4:0{P pm} 1:1{M} | 6:3{pm} 2:0 4:0{pm} 1:1 6:3{pm} 2:0 4:0{pm} 1:1 |
| "C" 5:3{pm} 2:1 4:2{pm} 1:0 6:3{pm} 2:1 4:2{pm} 1:0 | 5:3{pm} 2:1 4:2{pm} 1:0 6:3{pm} 2:1 4:2{pm} 1:0 |
